{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seduce, Breed, Conquer (SBC)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this medieval world, power isn\u2019t just forged in steel \u2014 it\u2019s born through your bloodline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seduce women, tame dragons, and even <i>breed your weapons</i> to create a growing legacy of warriors under your command. Every offspring strengthens your army in this absurdly epic and hilarious blend of strategy, RPG, and simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Bloodline:</strong> Influence women, dragons, and beasts to expand your legacy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breed Everything:</strong> From broken swords to legendary beasts \u2014 everything can reproduce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise and Conquer:</strong> Command up to 15 units of your lineage and lead them to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growth System:</strong> Children evolve through age stages and learn unique skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Tree:</strong> Develop branches such as Warrior, Charmer, Merchant, or Commander.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Humor:</strong> A serious medieval tone mixed with ridiculous breeding chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Single &amp; Multiplayer Modes</strong><br>Play solo and grow your bloodline or challenge others in 2v2 conquest battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every empire begins with a single seed...</i> \ud83c\udf38</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865490?t=1762379112","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865490/865a03a42e347d3cbdf90c4298f2f61dfbecac7c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762379112","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steam